  "goodToKnow": "Der Draht is wire: der Stacheldraht (barbed wire), der Kupferdraht. Old telephone connections went by wire, hence the idioms einen guten Draht zu jemandem haben (to have a good rapport with someone) and der heiße Draht (hotline). Auf Draht sein means to be on the ball. Drahtlos means wireless. Der Drahtesel (wire donkey) is a playful word for a bicycle. Plural: die Drähte."
